  "title": "Top Rated Businesses",
  "difficulty": "Easy",
  "company": "Yelp",
  "premium": true,
  "question": "Assume you are given a table of reviews from users. Define a top-rated place as a business whose reviews only consist of 4 or 5\nstars.\nWrite a query to get the number and percentage of businesses that are top-rated places.",
  "notes": [],
  "tables": [
